{"id":"459702","name":"苹果瘦身汤","author":"elmonte","authorId":"266491","desc":"","cover":"images/459702/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"苹果","amount":"4个"},{"name":"干海带","amount":"20g"},{"name":"薏米","amount":"30g"},{"name":"瘦肉","amount":"500g"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"海带泡软，切小块。","img":"images/459702/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"薏米用手泡30分钟。","img":"images/459702/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"瘦肉飞水，洗去浮沫。","img":"images/459702/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"苹果去皮，去核，切小块。","img":"images/459702/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"把以上材料放入电压力锅，按煲汤键开煮。(不用压力锅的，也可以放入汤锅，大火烧开转小火煲1.5-2小时。)","img":"images/459702/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"煮好放盐调味即可。","img":"images/459702/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"清润补钙袪湿又养颜。","img":"images/459702/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电压力锅、汤锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}